<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com raised by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com raised by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it raised its intermediate-term rating on 3Com Corp to accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- kept long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose three to 53-1/16.</p>
</text>
